## Verification

- [x] greek-first: the Greek form is each card's title
- [x] paradigm-tables: Person (rows) x role (columns), singular and plural under one header
- [x] structure-is-pedagogy: placement is taught by column alignment, not a list of rules
- [x] no-redundancy: the me / μου / εμένα split is taught once, in the cards; the table is the lookup
- [x] function-first-labels: learner handle leads (Doer / Target / Owner), short / long qualifies
- [x] frequency-priority: the short Target and Owner columns carry the weight, the Doer recedes
- [x] colour-honesty: only the pronoun in an example carries the case colour
- [x] progressive-disclosure: nothing is collapsed; the page is short enough not to need it
